# --- routable source addresses -------------------------------------------
# Everything above uses RFC 5737 TEST-NET ranges (198.51.100.0/24,
# 203.0.113.0/24), which is correct for documentation and which the app
# correctly refuses to send to a geolocation provider. But that means no
# SUCCESSFUL login above can ever resolve to a country, leaving the country
# chart and the new-country alert with nothing to demonstrate. These four lines
# use well-known public resolver addresses purely so those paths have real,
# routable input. They are not claims about anyone's traffic.
2026-08-24T09:16:00.000000+00:00 hetzner-prod sshd[4030]: Accepted publickey for patoo from 8.8.8.8 port 51300 ssh2: ED25519 SHA256:LmNoPqRsTuVwXyZ0123456789abcdefghijklmnop
